        plan("Why prohibition has not produced abolition", [13], "Responsibility diffusion, rare prosecution and unstable alternatives keep the practice alive despite the ban.", "Explain a persistent illegal practice through the specific mechanisms that sustain it."),
        plan("The caste nexus that makes this a dignity question", [14], "A remedy aimed only at safety answers the least fundamental part of the problem.", "Ground a sanitation-labour answer in the constitutional dignity articles the owners name."),
        plan("Rehabilitation against reparation", [15], "Forward-looking livelihood support is not a remedy for historical injustice and is not offered as one.", "Match the remedy claimed to the injustice actually being addressed."),
        plan("Evidence discipline for deaths and unsafe entry", [16, 17], "Counts differ by reporting source, and no option or key is recorded for the routed objective demand.", "Argue from persistence with a sourced and dated figure rather than from a headline number."),
        plan("Status statements, reform proposals and their costs", [18, 19], "Each recommended correction carries a recorded sequencing or capital cost that the answer must concede.", "Close with a graded verdict, a named institutional correction and its stated trade-off."),
